### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000
@receiver = Anes

### ============================================
### BASIC COMMANDS
### ============================================

### Get status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status

### Get balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/balance/coinbase

### Create transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/transaction/create?receiver={{receiver}}&amount=50

### Mine block
POST {{baseUrl}}/mine

### Get blockchain
GET {{baseUrl}}/chain

### Get mempool
GET {{baseUrl}}/mempool







